      "$\\displaystyle m=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^{\\pi}\\int_0^{2}\\rho^2\\cdot\\rho^2\\sin\\theta\\,d\\rho\\,d\\theta\\,d\\varphi$——被积函数是各变量的函数之积。",
      "$\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\varphi=2\\pi$，$\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta=2$，$\\int_0^2\\rho^4\\,d\\rho=\\frac{32}{5}$。",
      "<strong>结果：$m=\\frac{128}{5}\\pi\\approx 80.42$</strong>"
