  "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le 1,\\ x^2\\le y\\le x\\}$. Vnútorný integrál podľa $y$ dá ${@0}\\left({@1}\\right)$, potom $\\displaystyle{@2}\\int_0^1\\left({@3}\\right)dx={@4}\\frac{1}{{@5}}={@6}$.": "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le 1,\\ x^2\\le y\\le x\\}$。对 $y$ 的内层积分得 ${@0}\\left({@1}\\right)$，然后 $\\displaystyle{@2}\\int_0^1\\left({@3}\\right)dx={@4}\\frac{1}{{@5}}={@6}$。",
  "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$. $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$.": "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$。$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$。",
  "$L=x^2+y^2-\\lambda({@0})$: $2x={@1}\\lambda$, $2y={@2}\\lambda$. Dosadením do väzby $\\frac{\\lambda}{2}({@3}+{@4})={@5}$, teda $\\lambda={@6}$. Bod: $x={@7}$, $y={@8}$ (päta kolmice z počiatku na priamku), minimum $f={@9}$.": "$L=x^2+y^2-\\lambda({@0})$：$2x={@1}\\lambda$，$2y={@2}\\lambda$。代入约束条件得 $\\frac{\\lambda}{2}({@3}+{@4})={@5}$，因此 $\\lambda={@6}$。点：$x={@7}$，$y={@8}$（从原点向直线所作垂线的垂足），最小值 $f={@9}$。",
