  "$u=x$, $v'={@0}$, teda $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$: $\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$.": "$u=x$，$v'={@0}$，因此 $u'=1$，$v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$：$\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$。",
  "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$. {@3}. Rovina: $z={@4}$, po úprave $z={@5}$.": "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$。{@3}。切平面：$z={@4}$，整理得 $z={@5}$。",
  "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$, takže rovnica má {@3} {@4} s absolútnou hodnotou $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$ a s argumentmi $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$, $k=0,\\dots,{@10}$: ${@11}$.": "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$，所以方程有 {@3} {@4}，模均为 $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$，辐角为 $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$，$k=0,\\dots,{@10}$：${@11}$。",
  "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$ pre $\\xi$ medzi $0$ a $x$. {@0} Chceme ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$. Pre $n={@4}$ je ľavá strana ${@5}$, pre $n={@6}$ už ${@7}$. Preto $n={@8}$.": "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$，其中 $\\xi$ 介于 $0$ 与 $x$ 之间。{@0} 要求 ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$。当 $n={@4}$ 时左边为 ${@5}$，当 $n={@6}$ 时已经是 ${@7}$。因此 $n={@8}$。",
  "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, nie je splnená nutná podmienka konvergencie.": "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$，不满足收敛的必要条件。",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$。",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$, imaginárna časť je $0$. Odpoveď: ${@8};\\ 0$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$，$\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$。由棣莫弗定理 $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$，虚部为 $0$。答案：${@8};\\ 0$。",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, teda $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, kde $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ a uhol ${@9}^\\circ$ má rovnakú polohu ako ${@10}^\\circ$. Výsledok: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, odpoveď ${@13};\\ {@14}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$，$\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$，因此 $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$。由棣莫弗定理 $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$，其中 $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$，角 ${@9}^\\circ$ 与 ${@10}^\\circ$ 的终边相同。结果：$z^{{@11}}={@12}$，答案 ${@13};\\ {@14}$。",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$。",
